1
00:00:05,701 --> 00:00:07,621
HOWARD:
Make sure they remember, no peanuts.

2
00:00:07,786 --> 00:00:11,916
(Leonard:)Howard, every Thai restaurant in town
knows you can't eat peanuts.

3
00:00:12,416 --> 00:00:15,876
When they see me coming,
they go, "Ah, no-peanut boy."

4
00:00:26,847 --> 00:00:30,387
- Hello, Penny, Leonard just left.
- I know, I wanna talk to you.

5
00:00:30,559 --> 00:00:32,229
(Sheldon:)What would we talk about?

6
00:00:32,478 --> 00:00:34,978
We have no overlapping
areas of interest I'm aware of.

7
00:00:35,147 --> 00:00:38,397
- As you know, I don't care for chitchat.
- Can you just let me in?

8
00:00:38,567 --> 00:00:41,777
Well, all right, but I don't see this
as a promising endeavor.

9
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:44,070
(Penny:)Okay, here's the deal.

10
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:47,160
We'll throw Leonard a kickass
surprise party for his birthday.

11
00:00:47,326 --> 00:00:48,326
(Sheldon:)I hardly think so.

12
00:00:48,494 --> 00:00:50,744
Leonard made it clear
he doesn't want a party.

13
00:00:50,913 --> 00:00:53,203
(Howard:)Did someone say party?

14
00:00:54,458 --> 00:00:57,628
(Penny:)He just doesn't know he wants one,
because he's never had one.

15
00:00:57,795 --> 00:00:59,005
(Howard:)I suppose that's possible.

16
00:00:59,171 --> 00:01:05,021
(Howard:)But for the record, I've never had
a threesome and yet I still know I want one.

